description = "+8 AGI, +3 STR, +4 DEX, +1 hand size. Two colored slots and 2 plain slots. Two-handed. Blue slot: its card gains +8 block, +5 damage, and applies 1 Weaken on hit. Red slot: playing its card discards 2 cards of your choice and deals +15 damage. Combo — blue played immediately after red also applies 1 Vulnerable; red played immediately after blue costs 1 less tempo."
